{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651980/extras/Logo_Words.png?t=1746371442\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bankshot is a fast paced Arena Platformer.\u00a0 A fresh take on a stale genre; enjoy the dynamic battlefield while you test your reflexes.\u00a0 Embrace the chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651980/extras/ARENA_PLATFORMER.png?t=1746371442\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don\u2019t let the instant vaporization shot distract you from the win.\u00a0 The game is balanced to reward trick shots to knock your opponent off into the abyss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651980/extras/ezgif-2c528ca86f7af4.gif?t=1746371442\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651980/extras/STACK_POWER-UPS.png?t=1746371442\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gobble up as many as you can, they all work together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651980/extras/powerup-sequence.gif?t=1746371442\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651980/extras/OFFENSIVE_RE-SPAWNING.png?t=1746371442\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Not unlike a certain group of democratic liberators\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651980/extras/offensive-spawn.gif?t=1746371442\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3651980?t=1746371442","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651980/0d1d783108c7d332d21b01c62e0247fb970fcaf9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746371442","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651980/6021e4fe1bd61ff6046c0a097b0ba3c6569d7cff/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746371442","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651980/6021e4fe1bd61ff6046c0a097b0ba3c6569d7cff/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746371442","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651980/extras/Logo_Words.png?t=1746371442\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bankshot is a fast paced Arena Platformer.\u00a0 A fresh take on a stale genre; enjoy the dynamic battlefield while you test your reflexes.\u00a0 Embrace the chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651980/extras/ARENA_PLATFORMER.png?t=1746371442\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don\u2019t let the instant vaporization shot distract you from the win.\u00a0 The game is balanced to reward trick shots to knock your opponent off into the abyss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651980/extras/ezgif-2c528ca86f7af4.gif?t=1746371442\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p cla